;--- playfield in 3 display bands
; Room data index: Y = LevelRoomDataBase[LevelIndex] + RoomIndex.
; Each PF table is indexed by the same flattened room index.
; RoomIndex 0 and >= $0B override TOP PF1/PF2 with constants;
; middle and bottom PF bytes are loaded directly for every room.
; TopPF1RoomData and TopPF2RoomData are one-byte labels located
; immediately before the bottom tables: indexed reads may run into
; the following table. Preserve this layout (intentional or not).

